OL,3,AAdjusting triple lock to fund social
OL,4,Acare 'is about helping pensioners',
OL,5,ABurnham says, as Tories criticise plan
OL,6,
OL,7,F"Triple lock" means the state pension
OL,8,Fcurrently increases annually in line
OL,9,Fwith inflation, average wage growth, or
OL,10,F2.5% - whichever is highest
OL,12,FBut, from April 2030, the annual
OL,13,Fearnings link will be dropped which the
OL,14,Fgovernment thinks could save #15bn a
OL,15,Fyear by 2040 - here's what else Burnham
OL,16,Fannounced
OL,18,FTory chair Kevin Hollinrake criticises
OL,19,Fthe proposal, saying it amounts to
OL,20,F"taking money out of the pocket of
OL,21,Fpensioners and using it elsewhere in
OL,22,Fthe system"
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG4/39
