OL,3,AThree takeaways from Trump's 'Super
OL,4,AIntelligence' summit
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS President Donald Trump hosted a
OL,7,Fmeeting of top technology bosses on
OL,8,FTuesday for what he called "an
OL,9,Fextraordinary gathering" of the minds
OL,10,Fthat are "building America's Golden
OL,11,FAge".
OL,13,FThe guest list included leaders from
OL,14,FOpenAI, Anthropic, Nvidia, SpaceX, Meta
OL,15,Fand Google - all key figures in the US
OL,16,FAI industry.
OL,18,FThe meeting came as some tech
OL,19,Fexecutives and experts have called for
OL,20,Ftighter oversight of AI, citing
OL,21,Fconcerns about the potential risks it
OL,22,Fposes to humanity.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG9/39
