OL,3,ASouth Africa to clean up high-risk
OL,4,Aareas after 12 women killed
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe said gender-based violence "cannot
OL,7,Fbe accepted as a normal part of life in
OL,8,FSouth Africa" and admitted the country
OL,9,Fhas "not done enough" to protect women
OL,10,Fand girls.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
